  caseSender: Mrs. Kowalski
  caseSubject: My Weird Window
  caseBody: 'The Case:

    We just moved into this empty flat in the terrorized
    district. We took a picture, but upon developing it, we saw that the image in
    the window is completely wrong. The figure reflected looks unnatural and distorted.
    We demand to know what this reflected thing is and if our new home is safe.'
